  # game/screens.rpy:710
  old "{alpha=0.9}{size=-4}JACK MCNAMEE is a writer and game designer. {b}{color=#f00}H{/b}{/color}is other works incl{b}{color=#f00}U{/b}{/color}de the {b}{color=#f00}M{/b}{/color}egagames God Emperor and We Are Not Alone. He lives {b}{color=#f00}B{/b}{/color}ehind {b}{color=#f00}A{/b}{/color} keyboard in {b}{color=#f00}B{/b}{/color}risbane, {b}{color=#f00}A{/b}{/color}ustralia. He hears me in the pipes now. It's too late for him. For more information on Jack McNamee, please visit {a=https:/www.ashtowngames.com/}www.ashtowngames.com{/a}.\n{/size}{/alpha}"
  new "{alpha=0.9}{size=-4}杰克·麦克纳米（JACK MCNAMEE）是一个总爱{b}{color=#f00}胡{/b}{/color}思乱想的作家和游戏设计师。他的其他作品包括大型游戏《神皇》（God Emperor）与《我们并非孤身》（We Are Not Alone）。他宛如一个闭门不出、需要保{b}{color=#f00}姆{/b}{/color}照料的隐士，隐居在澳大利亚的布里斯班，将自己藏身于键盘之后，无视窗外驶过的大{b}{color=#f00}巴{/b}{/color}。如今他听见我在管道里的声响了。即使他惊恐地捂住嘴{b}{color=#f00}巴{/b}{/color}，对他来说也太迟了。了解杰克·麦克纳米的更多信息，可访问：{a=https:/www.ashtowngames.com/}www.ashtowngames.com{/a}.\n{/size}{/alpha}"

  # game/screens.rpy:712
  old "{alpha=0.9}{size=-4}JACK MCNAMEE is a writer and game designer. {color=#f00}H{/color}is other works incl{color=#f00}u{/color}de the {color=#f00}m{/color}egagames God Emperor and We Are Not Alone. He lives {color=#f00}b{/color}ehind {color=#f00}a{/color} keyboard in {color=#f00}B{/color}risbane, {color=#f00}A{/color}ustralia. Hurry. There isn't much time left. For more information on Jack McNamee, please visit {a=https:/www.ashtowngames.com/}www.ashtowngames.com{/a}.\n{/size}{/alpha}"
  new "{alpha=0.9}{size=-4}杰克·麦克纳米（JACK MCNAMEE）是一个总爱{color=#f00}胡{/color}思乱想的作家和游戏设计师。他的其他作品包括大型游戏《神皇》（God Emperor）与《我们并非孤身》（We Are Not Alone）。他宛如一个闭门不出、需要保{color=#f00}姆{/color}照料的隐士，隐居在澳大利亚的布里斯班，将自己藏身于键盘之后，无视窗外驶过的大{color=#f00}巴{/color}。快点。没剩下多少时间让你眼{color=#f00}巴{/color}巴地等了。了解杰克·麦克纳米的更多信息，可访问：{a=https:/www.ashtowngames.com/}www.ashtowngames.com{/a}.\n{/size}{/alpha}"

  # game/screens.rpy:714
  old "{alpha=0.9}{size=-4}JACK MCNAMEE is a writer and game designer. {color=#6d3d23}H{/color}is other works incl{color=#6d3d23}u{/color}de the {color=#6d3d23}m{/color}egagames God Emperor and We Are Not Alone. He lives {color=#6d3d23}b{/color}ehind {color=#6d3d23}a{/color} keyboard in {color=#6d3d23}B{/color}risbane, {color=#6d3d23}A{/color}ustralia. I began whispering to him some time ago. This text is the result. For more information on Jack McNamee, please visit {a=https:/www.ashtowngames.com/}www.ashtowngames.com{/a}.\n{/size}{/alpha}"
  new "{alpha=0.9}{size=-4}杰克·麦克纳米（JACK MCNAMEE）是一个总爱{color=#6d3d23}胡{/color}思乱想的作家和游戏设计师。他的其他作品包括大型游戏《神皇》（God Emperor）与《我们并非孤身》（We Are Not Alone）。他宛如一个闭门不出、需要保{color=#6d3d23}姆{/color}照料的隐士，隐居在澳大利亚的布里斯班，将自己藏身于键盘之后，无视窗外驶过的大{color=#6d3d23}巴{/color}。前阵子我开始对他低语。这段文字就是他眼{color=#6d3d23}巴{/color}巴看着屏幕敲出的结果。了解杰克·麦克纳米的更多信息，可访问：{a=https:/www.ashtowngames.com/}www.ashtowngames.com{/a}.\n{/size}{/alpha}"

  # game/screens.rpy:716
  old "{alpha=0.9}{size=-4}JACK MCNAMEE is a writer and game designer. His other works include the megagames God Emperor and We Are Not Alone. He lives behind a keyboard in Brisbane, Australia. For more information on Jack McNamee, please visit {a=https:/www.ashtowngames.com/}www.ashtowngames.com{/a}.\n{/size}{/alpha}"
  new "{alpha=0.9}{size=-4}杰克·麦克纳米（JACK MCNAMEE）是一个总爱胡思乱想的作家和游戏设计师。他的其他作品包括大型游戏《神皇》（God Emperor）与《我们并非孤身》（We Are Not Alone）。他宛如一个闭门不出、需要保姆照料的隐士，隐居在澳大利亚的布里斯班，将自己藏身于键盘之后，无视窗外驶过的大巴。了解杰克·麦克纳米的更多信息，可访问：{a=https:/www.ashtowngames.com/}www.ashtowngames.com{/a}.\n{/size}{/alpha}"
